    "title": "Hiring Production Engineer at Voltas Digital Technologies",
    "description": "Voltas Digital Technologies is actively seeking a talented and motivated Production Engineer to join our dynamic team in Chandigarh. This is an excellent opportunity for professionals who are passionate about making a real impact in a fast-growing organization.\n\nAbout Voltas Digital Technologies:\nVoltas Digital Technologies is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Ensure product quality meets internal and customer specifications\n• Coordinate with logistics for dispatching finished goods\n• Ensure compliance with safety regulations and factory acts\n• Coordinate with design and engineering teams on product improvements\n• Ensure environmental compliance and waste management\n• Conduct root cause analysis for quality rejections and defects\n• Manage raw material procurement and inventory levels\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 0-1 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Project Management\n• Proficiency in PPAP\n• Proficiency in SAP MM/PP\n• Proficiency in Kaizen\n• Proficiency in Quality Control\n• Proficiency in SolidWorks\n• Proficiency in FMEA\n• Proficiency in Six Sigma\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Mobile and internet reimbursement\n• Learning & development budget\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Flexible working hours\n• Life and accident insurance\n• Salary Range: 2.5 LPA - 6 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Chandigarh, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Voltas Digital Technologies!",
